stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: Create / Upload / Fork
    Draft --> Validating: Run validation
    Validating --> Draft: Fix issues
    Validating --> Tested: Checks pass
    Tested --> Testing: Run test
    Testing --> Tested: Test passes
    Testing --> Draft: Change content
    Tested --> PublishReview: Publish version
    PublishReview --> Tested: Changes requested
    PublishReview --> Published: Approved
    Published --> Draft: Create next version
    Published --> Deprecated: Deprecate
    Deprecated --> Archived: Archive
    Draft --> Archived: Discard
